data: {"id":"f1","object":"chat.completion.chunk","choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"**Hand over the map.** Here is everything we found, and five first tickets that come out of it.\n\n```\n{\"foundry_map\":1,\"venture_id\":\"arca\",\"idea\":\"Studio owners lose hours a week chasing who fired what. I want the kiln to keep its own book.\",\"body\":\"## Known knowns\\n- Shared pottery studios rent shelf space and kiln firings to members, usually by the month.\\n- Most run their bookings on a paper sheet by the kiln, or a group chat.\\n- The founder has run one studio for six years and knows twelve other owners by name.\\n\\n## Known unknowns\\n- Who exactly is this for? — **Owners of studios with 20 to 80 members**, not hobbyists. Settled by the founder.\\n- What do they do today, and what does it cost? — A paper sheet, and about four hours a week chasing who fired what. Settled by the founder.\\n- What would stop someone copying this? — Still open. A booking screen is not a barrier; every feature can be copied next month.\\n- What would make this a bad idea? — If owners will not pay more than they pay for the group chat, which is nothing. Still open.\\n\\n## Unknown knowns — what the founder knew and had not said\\n- Owners hate anything that makes members feel watched; firing logs must not read as surveillance.\\n- The founder will not take on card payments in the first year.\\n\\n## Unknown unknowns — the landmines, and how far the search reached\\n- Kiln firings have insurance conditions in some areas: who loaded it may need to be recorded. Searched UK insurer guidance only.\\n- Members often share one login on a studio tablet, so \\\"who booked\\\" may not be a person.\\n- Two earlier booking tools for studios closed within two years; neither said why. Not yet found out.\"}\n```\n\n```\n{\"foundry_plan\":1,\"venture_id\":\"arca\",\"repo\":\"arca\",\"source_title\":\"The founding map\",\"created_at\":\"2026-10-02T09:00:00.000Z\",\"tickets\":[{\"slug\":\"Why Studio Tools Closed\",\"title\":\"Find out why the last two studio booking tools closed\",\"source\":\"Unknown unknowns: two earlier tools closed and neither said why\",\"depends_on\":[],\"body\":\"# Find out why the last two studio booking tools closed\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Research · **Depends on:** —\\n\\n## Why this matters (for the founder)\\nFrom the founding map: Unknown unknowns: two earlier tools closed and neither said why\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n- [ ] The founder can read the answer in one page.\"},{\"slug\":\"kiln-insurance-records\",\"title\":\"Check what insurers ask a studio to record about firings\",\"source\":\"Unknown unknowns: insurance conditions on who loaded the kiln\",\"depends_on\":[],\"body\":\"# Check what insurers ask a studio to record about firings\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Research · **Depends on:** —\\n\\n## Why this matters (for the founder)\\nFrom the founding map: Unknown unknowns: insurance conditions on who loaded the kiln\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n- [ ] The founder can read the answer in one page.\"},{\"slug\":\"ask-twelve-owners\",\"title\":\"Ask the twelve owners the founder knows what they would pay\",\"source\":\"Known unknowns: what would make this a bad idea\",\"depends_on\":[\"why-studio-tools-closed\"],\"body\":\"# Ask the twelve owners the founder knows what they would pay\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Research · **Depends on:** —\\n\\n## Why this matters (for the founder)\\nFrom the founding map: Known unknowns: what would make this a bad idea\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n- [ ] The founder can read the answer in one page.\"},{\"slug\":\"shared-tablet-booking\",\"title\":\"Booking that works on one shared studio tablet\",\"source\":\"Unknown unknowns: members share one login\",\"depends_on\":[\"kiln-insurance-records\"],\"body\":\"# Booking that works on one shared studio tablet\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Research · **Depends on:** —\\n\\n## Why this matters (for the founder)\\nFrom the founding map: Unknown unknowns: members share one login\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n- [ ] The founder can read the answer in one page.\"},{\"slug\":\"kiln-book-first-page\",\"title\":\"One page showing this week’s firings and who booked them\",\"source\":\"Known knowns: bookings run on a paper sheet by the kiln\",\"depends_on\":[\"shared-tablet-booking\"],\"body\":\"# One page showing this week’s firings and who booked them\\n\\n**Status:** Todo · **Area:** Research · **Depends on:** —\\n\\n## Why this matters (for the founder)\\nFrom the founding map: Known knowns: bookings run on a paper sheet by the kiln\\n\\n## Acceptance criteria\\n- [ ] The founder can read the answer in one page.\"}]}\n```\n\nStrike anything that is not yours. Nothing is filed until you press."},"finish_reason":null}]}

